   |B_n(c)| = int_0^1 [e^{-ct^2} - (1-ct^2/n)^n] dt
            <= int_0^1 ((ct^2)^2/n) e^{-ct^2} dt   [Lema 6.1 at x = ct^2,
                                                    legal since 0<=ct^2<=c<=n]
            = (c^2/n) I_2(c) <= kappa_B / n.        CORRECT.

